 * Sensor: Silicon Labs Si1182-GMR
 *
 * Reads proximity (PS1) and ambient light (ALS1) every 500 ms,
 * logs timestamped samples to biometric_log.txt, and cleans up
 * on SIGINT (Ctrl+C).
 *
 * Build:  gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o si1182_logger si1182_logger.c
