                     "CO2=%.0f ppm, Temp=%.2f C, RH=%.2f %%RH, Vent=%s",
                     co2, temp, rh,
                     vent == VENT_OFF ? "OFF" :
                     vent == VENT_LOW ? "LOW" : "HIGH");
