 * I2C bus 1, BMP180 at address 0x77
 * Push-button on GPIO 4 (internal pull-up, falling-edge interrupt)
 * Logs pressure to pressure_log.txt every 2 s while button is pressed.
 *
 * Build: gcc -O2 -Wall -o bmp180_logger bmp180_logger.c -lpigpio -lrt
 * Run:   sudo ./bmp180_logger
 */

