 * on GPIO17 (BCM) and GPIO27 (BCM).  Two 9600 8N1 UART ports read 6-digit
 * codes from /dev/serial0 and /dev/serial1.  Codes must match both ports
 * and the constant "123456" to unlock the door for 2 s.
 *
